  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5025.06 Decking to be Covered. All barges with decks of wooden construction shall have all exposed decking covered with a minimum of one inch of clean sand.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 5000) #6055, eff 7-1-95, EXPIRED: 7-1-03\n\nNew. #8117, INTERIM, eff 7-14-04, EXPIRED: 1-10-05\n\nNew. #8261, eff 1-21-05; ss by #9765-A, eff 8-2-10 (from Saf- C 5025.05); ss by #12738, eff 4-30-19",
